{
  "title": "Quaintly Crispy Mexican Shrimp Fajitas",
  "description": "A pescatarian-friendly Mexican dish featuring malty and crispy shrimp, dried apricots, and beurre-monte, served in a bento-box as fajitas.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "diet": [
    "pescatarian"
